>  <SELECTION_REASON>
Interactively reviewed graph. Ru–N–O 177.52°, N–O 1.15604 Å, g-xTB N–O WBO 1.9082. The closed-shell assignment for this near-linear terminal ligand is N≡[O+], with metal formal charge +2 and total charge +1. The authors compare the series by IR and Raman spectroscopy, This supports the Ru(II)/NO⁺ description of {RuNO}⁶; The dichloro TPA species was checked by composition. Localized 18 aromatic-ring bonds using WBOs and original bond lengths. The atom order and coordinates of all 45 atoms agree between XYZ and SDF. Lengths of 43 nonmetal covalent bonds: 42 within range, 0 outside range and 1 with sparse controls.

